  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Barn i v&#xe4;pnad i konflikt</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Childen in armed conflict</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tides Center - Watchlist on Children in Armed Conflict arbetar med att skydda och tillgodose m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter f&#xf6;r barn som befinner sig i v&#xe4;pnad konflikt. De f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultaten utifr&#xe5;n st&#xf6;det &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra situationen f&#xf6;r barn som leveri i v&#xe4;pnad konflikt men &#xe4;ven att det sker en kunskapsspridning inom omr&#xe5;det barn och v&#xe4;pnad konflikt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tides Center - Watchlist on Children in Armed Conflict is working to protect and respond to human rights for children in armed conflict. The expected results from the support are to improve the situation of children living in armed conflicts but also the spread of knowledge in the area of children and armed conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
